FIXES.patch — minimal Batch 03 fixes (applied to repo root).

Fixes:
  1. enterprise-mas/rust-core/Cargo.toml + crates/{ai-bridge,api,cli,scheduler-service,worker}/Cargo.toml
     : license "Proprietary" -> "LicenseRef-Proprietary" (6 files) so cargo-deny
     : treats them as allowed proprietary crates instead of unlicensed.
  2. enterprise-mas/rust-core/deny.toml : rewritten to cargo-deny 0.20 schema;
     : licenses.allow includes LicenseRef-Proprietary + CDLA-Permissive-2.0;
     : bans LLM provider SDKs in rust-core; sources restricted to crates.io.
  3. enterprise-mas/rust-core/Cargo.lock : upgraded rustls 0.23.45->0.23.46,
     : rustls-webpki 0.103.15->0.103.16, tokio 1.53.1->1.54.1 (+tokio-util)
     : to resolve advisories found by cargo audit.
  4. enterprise-mas/python-orchestrator/src/mas_orchestrator/tools/builtins/webhook.py
     : ruff E501 line-too-long (101>100) fixed by splitting the string literal.
  5. Environment (not a file diff): pip install psycopg installed (3.3.6);
     : psycopg-binary alone could not be imported as psycopg.
  6. Environment (not a file diff): pip install pgvector psycopg_pool
     : types-defusedxml beautifulsoup4 pypdf python-docx installed the missing
     : deps the mypy/pytest suite imports.

